d live challenges that mirror real-world decision-making.","link_url":null},{"icon":"gear","title":"Mass customization","body":"Learning happens by building. At NAMTECH, classrooms don\u2019t have desks but machines used in the industry.","link_url":null},{"icon":"leaf","title":"Waste reduction","body":"Our curriculum is co-designed and co-delivered with academicians from global universities.","link_url":null},{"icon":"flask","title":"Education and research","body":null,"link_url":null},{"icon":"globe","title":"Sustainability","body":null,"link_url":null}],"style":"joined","cta_label":null,"cta_url":null}},{"type":"post_list","label":null,"anchor":null,"is_visible":true,"data":{"heading":"How It\u2019s Done: Some Student Stories","post_type":"story","category":null,"limit":3,"cta_label":"All stories","cta_url":"\/impact\/stories","layout":"carousel"}},{"type":"media_cards","label":null,"anchor":null,"is_visible":true,"data":{"eyebrow":null,"heading":"Explore More Labs","body":null,"items":[{"image":33,"logo":null,"icon":null,"tag":null,"date":null,"title":"Sustainable Energy Labs","subtitle":null,"body":"Work on real-world renewable systems, from generation to consumption, using IoT-driven optimisation.","meta":null,"link_url":null},{"image":83,"logo":null,"icon":null,"tag":null,"date":null,"title":"Hydrogen Innovation Lab","subtitle":null,"body":"Explore the full hydrogen ecosystem, from production to storage to fuel cell applications.","meta":null,"link_url":null},{"image":84,"logo":null,"icon":null,"tag":null,"date":null,"title":"Water Stewardship Lab","subtitle":null,"body":"Solve water challenges through smart monitoring, filtration, and climate-resilient systems.","meta":null,"link_url":null},{"image":35,"logo":null,"icon":null,"tag":null,"date":null,"title":"Smart Grid & Energy Systems Lab","subtitle":null,"body":"Build and optimise intelligent energy networks with automation, efficiency, and grid analytics.","meta":null,"link_url":null},{"image":82,"logo":nu