(113, 'tabs', NULL, NULL, 1, 2, '{"eyebrow":null,"heading":"Campus & Facilities","body":null,"tabs":[{"label":"Campus","title":"Campus","body":"<p>Our world-class campus combines modern architecture with state-of-the-art experiential learning facilities. Designed for active collaboration, students interact with advanced machinery, collaborative robots, and high-performance computing clusters in an environment that mirrors premier global factories.<\/p>","image":91},{"label":"Classrooms","title":"Classrooms","body":"<p>Our interactive lecture theatres and smart classrooms feature collaborative seating, high-definition digital smart boards, and live simulation capabilities, allowing faculty and industry experts to seamlessly blend conceptual teaching with real-time digital factory demonstrations.<\/p>","image":95},{"label":"Hostel","title":"Hostel","body":"<p>Well-appointed student residences offer modern amenities, high-speed connectivity, communal recreation spaces, and round-the-clock security, fostering a vibrant residential learning community where ideas and peer collaboration thrive.<\/p>","image":55},{"label":"Library","title":"Library","body":"<p>The NAMTECH Knowledge Centre provides extensive physical collections and 24\/7 digital access to global technical publications, research journals, standard engineering codes, and international manufacturing case studies.<\/p>","image":102}],"layout":"standard","tone":null}', '2026-11-18 06:43:46', '2026-11-18 06:43:46', 'page', 10),
